<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-4718] Regression for HDFS Notebook Storage</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-4718</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Hi,&lt;br/&gt;
 I&apos;m using HDFS to store Zeppelin Notebooks. With &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/3668&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;PR #3668&lt;/a&gt; I noticed a regression.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;I configured Zeppelin with the following environment variables to store Notebooks in HDFS.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;
ZEPPELIN_NOTEBOOK_STORAGE: org.apache.zeppelin.notebook.repo.FileSystemNotebookRepo
ZEPPELIN_NOTEBOOK_DIR: hdfs:&lt;span class=&quot;code-comment&quot;&gt;//hdfs.example.com.de:8020/zeppelin/notebook&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Because of &#160;&lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/3668/files#diff-179ea3a816210bb9904baabec1a552e4L397-R397&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;this change&lt;/a&gt;, zeppelin gets a relative path,  which is wrong with a full HDFS path.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment></environment>
